00:58:02.890 --> 00:58:11.510
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by Mr. Torey Malatia, who wanders the empty halls of WBEZ after each pledge drive is over saying--

00:58:11.510 --> 00:58:16.220
<v Tobias Wolff>All my pretty ones? Did you say all? Oh hell-kite! All?

00:58:16.220 --> 00:58:20.140
